+ * only ever written here, so what lies past the largest `left` written since it was last zeroed is zero already: only
+ * [left, dirty) is cleared. The bytes the GPU is given are the same. Off (every draw zeroes all, as before) while
+ * /var/db/nord2-metal/no-thumbgrid-ubo or no-thumbgrid exists. Counted for rwa_tg_ubo_stats.
